    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d90">

                <pb facs="0190" n="116" xml:id="pg116"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5328</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 13, 1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received June 16, 7 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1391. Diplomatic Commission arrived. All well. Much pleased with experience thus
                    far. Had long conference with Railway Commission which taking hold earnestly,
                    working wisely, diplomatically and will accomplish much if Government
                    permits.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
